Keys ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

 Global keys
  1-5                  Sessions; Graph; Quotas; Messages; Tools
  c                    open the CTO session
  C                    focus the CTO box for its own keys: enter opens the full CTO, ctrl+] returns, esc skips a tip
  tab                  move to the next field; back to Sessions
  ?                    help
  /                    filter; find a node; enter selects the first match and esc cancels
  esc                  back; clear or back; Graph; clear
  R                    refresh; rescan
  q, ctrl+c            quit
  enter                go into the selected session in herdr (ctrl+] returns on fallback), or run the selected row's
                       action; detail; open the selected message body; open the selected agent card; select the first
                       match; open Sessions filtered to this agent's project; open the difference plan; open the item
                       details and actions
  up/down, j/k         move the selection; select a conversation; select a subscription; move the selection between
                       nodes; move
  left/right           select the previous message in the conversation; select the next message in the conversation;
                       agent; move the selection between nodes; column

 Graph
  +, =                 zoom in
  -                    zoom out
  shift+left           pan
  shift+right          pan
  shift+up             pan
  shift+down           pan
  ,                    previous neighbour
  .                    next neighbour
  n                    new
 Graph find
  backspace, ctrl+h    delete
 agent card
  n                    start a new session in this project (the same form, filled from here)
  t                    tools
  a                    autonomy
  D                    name project
  more below
up/down scroll  esc close help  q quit
